Kaggle python jupyter notebooks. These must be able to run locally on my mac m3 using uv and .venv inside shared python dependency eda folder. 

The other notebooks in KaggleNotebooks repo are kaggle exports, and dont have the data locally on disk, so stick to eda folder.

